      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "You are not fighting to escape the quiet; you are fighting to prove that the quiet is not your only reality. The exhaustion you feel is the price of maintaining a spark in a hurricane, and that spark is the only thing that keeps you from becoming part of the empty space. Letting go of the struggle is not an option; it is the only way to stop the pain of trying to hold onto something that cannot be held.",
